> # LANGFUSE_HOST=http://localhost:3000
> # TESSERACT_CMD=C:\Program Files\Tesseract-OCR\tesseract.exe
>
> # Docker:
> LANGFUSE_HOST=http://langfuse:3000
> TESSERACT_CMD=
> ```

